<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Perbaiki Data KPM · <%= access.kpm_name %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/style.css?v=1.8.36.4"><style>.edit-wrap{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 16px}.edit-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dfe7ee;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(15,35,55,.07)}.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.full{grid-column:1/-1}.field span{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#52677d;margin-bottom:6px}.input{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}.actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;margin-top:20px}.help{font-size:12px;color:#6b7d90}@media(max-width:650px){.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.full{grid-column:auto}.edit-wrap{padding:14px 10px}.edit-card{padding:18px}}</style></head><body><main class="edit-wrap"><div class="edit-card"><div class="eyebrow">PORTAL KPM · PERBAIKI DATA</div><h1><%= access.kpm_name %></h1><p><%= access.kpm_code %> · <%= access.kpm_type==='POSYANDU'?'Posyandu':'Satuan Pendidikan' %></p><div class="notice">Data pada halaman ini berasal dari <strong>Master KPM</strong>. Perubahan yang dikirim melalui form ini menjadi <strong>pengajuan perbaikan</strong> dan tidak langsung mengubah Master KPM.</div><form method="post" action="/portal/kpm/<%= portalToken %>/profile/edit"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><div class="form-grid"><label class="field"><span>Nama KPM</span><input class="input" name="name" value="<%= access.kpm_name||'' %>" maxlength="200" required></label><% if(access.kpm_type==='SATUAN_PENDIDIKAN'){ %><label class="field"><span>Jenjang/Keterangan</span><input class="input" name="education_level" value="<%= access.education_level||'' %>" maxlength="120" required></label><label class="field"><span>NPSN</span><input class="input" name="npsn" value="<%= access.npsn||'' %>" maxlength="20" inputmode="numeric" required></label><label class="field"><span>Kepala Satuan Pendidikan</span><input class="input" name="head_name" value="<%= access.head_name||'' %>" maxlength="150" required></label><label class="field"><span>Kontak Kepala Satuan Pendidikan</span><input class="input" name="head_phone" value="<%= access.head_phone||'' %>" maxlength="30" required></label><label class="field"><span>PIC MBG Satuan Pendidikan</span><input class="input" name="pic_name" value="<%= access.pic_name||'' %>" maxlength="150" required></label><label class="field"><span>Kontak PIC MBG Satuan Pendidikan</span><input class="input" name="pic_phone" value="<%= access.pic_phone||'' %>" maxlength="30" required></label><% }else{ %><label class="field"><span>Jenjang/Keterangan</span><input class="input" name="education_level" value="" maxlength="120" placeholder="Tidak digunakan untuk Posyandu"></label><label class="field"><span>Kader Posyandu</span><input class="input" name="cadre_name" value="<%= access.cadre_name||'' %>" maxlength="150" required></label><label class="field"><span>Kontak Kader Posyandu</span><input class="input" name="cadre_phone" value="<%= access.cadre_phone||'' %>" maxlength="30" required></label><% } %><label class="field full"><span>Alamat</span><textarea class="input" name="address" rows="3" maxlength="2000" required><%= access.address||'' %></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Latitude</span><input class="input" name="latitude" value="<%= access.latitude??'' %>" inputmode="decimal" required></label><label class="field"><span>Longitude</span><input class="input" name="longitude" value="<%= access.longitude??'' %>" inputmode="decimal" required></label></div><p class="help">Kode KPM dan Jenis KPM tidak dapat diubah dari Portal KPM. Koordinat digunakan untuk titik View Maps.</p><div class="actions"><a class="outline-btn" href="/portal/kpm/<%= portalToken %>">Batal</a><button class="primary-btn" type="submit">Ajukan Perbaikan Data</button></div></form></div></main></body></html>